      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Political Bubbles & NIMBYism",
      "description": "Citizens are highly polarized and isolated in social bubbles, proposing solutions or pushing back on reforms without understanding the broader impacts, trade-offs, or equity implications beyond their circles.",
