      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Performative Bipartisanship",
      "description": "Statements, town halls, and pledges perform collaboration without doing it; missing is a structured, sprint-like way for people who are supposed to disagree to define a shared problem and build something together.",
