      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Cross-Jurisdiction Election Distrust",
      "description": "Election officials struggle to cut through fragmented information channels, and even people who trust their own town's elections increasingly distrust elections run by other cities and states.",
